<title>INDONESIA: Indonesia widens dlr/dph intervention band.</title>
<headline>Indonesia widens dlr/dph intervention band.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1997-07-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bank Indonesia, the central bank, said on Friday it has widened its dollar-rupiah intervention band to 12 percent from eight percent.</p>
<p>&quot;We have widened the band to 12 percent from eight percent,&quot; Djakaria, director of the foreign exchange department, told Reuters.  </p>
<p>Djakaria said the new band effective from today was 2,374-2,678 to the dollar.</p>
</text>
